{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o050a","title":"张绣降而复反与曹操宛败","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o050a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操到宛，张绣先降后反，曹操战败受伤，曹昂和曹安民遇害。","evidence":["wudi-e-o050a-q"]},{"id":"wendi-e-p106b-account","label":"裴注·典论自叙","text":"建安之初，时年十一岁，曹丕于张绣反叛时乘马逃脱。","evidence":["wendi-e-p106b-q"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-adc839b7d1edc356b77b","label":"正文","text":"太祖南征军淯水绣举众降","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-66d7130f3b50aa50a625"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-f3243179641f1928fe90","label":"正文","text":"计漏绣掩袭太祖军败二子没还保穰","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-ff71cd5fd221e28b5c5b"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-1512c32cb2a8cc60a519","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"绣用贾诩计乞徙军掩太祖太祖不备故败","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-16c794bc2c6a7efcabdf"]},{"id":"lizang-a-409cc34f89f6e4628887","label":"正文","text":"太祖征荆州至宛，张绣迎降","evidence":["lizang-q-1c5444ff52132f9bc957"]},{"id":"lizang-a-c950118931b6c1d6b252","label":"正文","text":"太祖延绣置酒高会，韦持大斧立后，所至辄举斧目之，竟酒绣莫敢仰视","evidence":["lizang-q-ea34e7392968597c78eb"]},{"id":"lizang-a-6e9347868b92fa2cbfc8","label":"正文","text":"后十余日绣反袭太祖营，太祖出战不利轻骑引去","evidence":["lizang-q-1cbf0e590bade9fba0e3"]},{"id":"lizang-a-01c8df5dae2bd90dfe4b","label":"正文","text":"韦战于门中殊死拒贼，以长戟左右击，被数十创，瞋目大骂而死，贼取其头传观","evidence":["lizang-q-7f3900fa715968a7461e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"战败受伤","evidence":["wudi-e-o050a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0131","role":"降而复反","evidence":["wudi-e-o050a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0132","role":"遇害","evidence":["wudi-e-o050a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0133","role":"遇害","evidence":["wudi-e-o050a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"逃脱","evidence":["wendi-e-p106b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0182","role":"计所出","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-16c794bc2c6a7efcabdf"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0012","role":"持大斧侍卫；拒战而死","evidence":["lizang-q-ea34e7392968597c78eb","lizang-q-7f3900fa715968a7461e"]}],"place":{"text":"宛","evidence":["wudi-e-o050a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安二年春正月","year":197,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o050a-q","wudi-q-o050","wudi-q-b-40d8b7057f4a29d6fe0d"],"chronology":"wudi-y197","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o050","basis":"建安二年春正月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,299,"O050a"],"order":134}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0012","name":"典韦","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0131","name":"张绣","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0132","name":"曹昂","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0133","name":"曹安民","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0182","name":"贾诩","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-16c794bc2c6a7efcabdf","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-3f9f88db75a27c71879a","layer":"pei","quote":"绣降，（凌统）用贾诩计，乞徙军就高道；道由太祖屯中。绣又曰：‘车少而重，乞得使兵各被甲。’太祖信绣，皆听之。绣乃严兵，入屯，掩太祖。太祖不备，故败","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9e423635425d66361a22","start":60,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-66d7130f3b50aa50a625","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-cf84eafed97482cd953c","layer":"original","quote":"太祖南征，军淯水〖4〗。绣等举众降","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":254,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":13,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-ff71cd5fd221e28b5c5b","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-cf84eafed97482cd953c","layer":"original","quote":"计漏，绣掩袭太祖；太祖军败，二子没〖5〗。绣还保穰，﹝一﹞太祖比年攻之，不克","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":254,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":55,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-1c5444ff52132f9bc957","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-645291c3846bd2e4fd4f","layer":"original","quote":"太祖征荆州，至宛，张绣迎降","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-1cbf0e590bade9fba0e3","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-1f91b0944f647a7e25ae","layer":"original","quote":"后十余日，绣反，袭太祖营。太祖出战，不利，轻骑引去","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-7f3900fa715968a7461e","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-1f91b0944f647a7e25ae","layer":"original","quote":"韦战于门中，贼不得入；兵遂散从他门并入。时韦校尚有十余人〖21〗，皆殊死战，无不一当十。贼前后至，稍多，韦以长戟左右击之；一叉入，辄十余矛摧。左右死伤者略尽，韦被数十创。短兵接战，贼前搏之；韦双挟两贼击杀之，余贼不敢前。韦复前突贼，杀数人；创重发，瞋目大骂而死。贼乃敢前，取其头，传观之；覆军就视其躯","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":176,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ea34e7392968597c78eb","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-645291c3846bd2e4fd4f","layer":"original","quote":"太祖甚悦，延绣及其将帅，置酒高会。太祖行酒〖19〗，韦持大斧立后；刃径尺，太祖所至之前，韦辄举斧目之。竟酒〖20〗，绣及其将帅莫敢仰视","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-p106b-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-6eb68753e8e520d9914c","layer":"pei","quote":"建安初，上南征荆州，至宛，张绣降，旬日而反；亡兄孝廉子修、从兄安民遇害。时余年十一岁，乘马得脱。","attribution":"裴注·典论自叙","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":521,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2aa5d4559ce229d0d61c","start":289,"end":337,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o050a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c2d0fc350fb933237a70","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖3〗，公到宛〖4〗。张绣降，既而悔之，复反。公与战，军败，为流矢所中。长子昂、弟子安民遇害〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-40d8b7057f4a29d6fe0d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-40d8b7057f4a29d6fe0d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖3〗二年：建安二年（公元 197）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":305,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-de6807349faf5c41a470","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o050","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c2d0fc350fb933237a70","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖3〗，公到宛〖4〗。张绣降，既而悔之，复反。公与战，军败，为流矢所中。长子昂、弟子安民遇害〖5〗。﹝一﹞公乃引兵还舞阴〖6〗，绣将骑来抄〖7〗。公击破之，绣奔穰〖8〗，与刘表合。公谓诸将曰：“吾降张绣等，失不便取其质〖9〗，以至于此。吾知所以败。诸卿观之：自今以后，不复败矣！”遂还许。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
